---
---

<section style="position:relative;padding:150px 0 80px;background:var(--cu-cream);overflow:hidden;">
  <div class="paws faint"></div>

  <!-- Decorative gold blob -->
  <div style="position:absolute;top:120px;right:-60px;width:280px;height:280px;background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,199,0,0.18), transparent 65%);border-radius:50%;filter:blur(20px);pointer-events:none;"></div>

  <div class="container-wide" style="position:relative;z-index:2;">
    <div style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;">
      <div class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center;">
        <span class="tick"></span>About · Meet your trainer
      </div>

      <h1 class="display-title" style="margin-bottom:24px;">
        I'd rather <span class="scribble"><span style="position:relative;z-index:1;">train you well</span></span> than impress you fast.
      </h1>

      <p style="font-size:19px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--fg2);font-weight:500;max-width:660px;margin:0 auto 36px;">
        That sentence sums up how I work. No flashy seven-day fixes, no
        gimmicky tools, no franchise rotation — just me, your family, and
        a written plan that fits the dog you actually live with.
      </p>

      <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;align-items:center;">
        <a href="#story" class="btn btn-navy btn-lg">
          Read my story
          <i data-lucide="arrow-down" style="width:18px;height:18px;"></i>
        </a>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg">
          Schedule a Meet &amp; Greet
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
